{"lines": ["Stop logging your sets in your notes app.", "Here's why.", "Notes can't tell you what to lift today.", "Forge can.", "Every workout comes planned... with the exact weight for every set.", "Tap any exercise... and it shows you how to do it.", "It tracks your sleep and recovery over two weeks.", "And it logs your food from a photo... or a barcode.", "No spreadsheets. No guessing.", "It's called Forge.", "Try it free... link in bio."], "tempo": 1.06, "tail": 1.4, "scenes": [{"l": 0, "cap": false, "html": "<div class='e mono' style='left:540px;top:300px' data-l='0' data-fx='none'>YOUR GYM LOG</div><div class='e an' style='left:540px;top:500px;font-size:160px' data-l='0' data-fx='none'>STOP LOGGING</div><div class='e an' style='left:540px;top:680px;font-size:160px' data-l='0' data-fx='none'>SETS IN <span class='rd'>NOTES</span></div><div class='e card' style='left:540px;top:1100px;width:780px;background:#F5F1E3;border-color:#D8D2BE' data-l='0' data-dl='0' data-fx='none' data-rot='-3'><div style='font-family:JB;font-size:26px;color:#8A8470;letter-spacing:.1em'>NOTES \u00b7 GYM LOG</div><div style='font-family:Inter Tight,sans-serif;font-size:50px;line-height:1.35;color:#2A2925;margin-top:16px'>bench 60 x 8?? <br>row ... same as last time<br>legs?? maybe tmrw</div></div><div class='e' style='left:540px;top:1100px' data-l='0' data-dl='1.4' data-fx='none'><svg width='760' height='300' viewBox='0 0 760 300' style='overflow:visible'><path class='draw' data-l='0' data-dl='1.4' data-d='.35' d='M0 280 L760 20' stroke='#FF4B4B' stroke-width='14' stroke-linecap='round' /></svg></div>"}, {"l": 1, "cap": false, "html": "<div class='e panel' data-l='1' data-dl='-.12'></div><div class='e an' style='left:540px;top:800px;font-size:250px;color:#0B0B0C' data-l='1' data-fx='chars'>HERE'S<br>WHY</div>"}, {"l": 2, "tint": "red", "html": "<div class='e an' style='left:540px;top:420px;font-size:120px' data-l='2' data-fx='words'>LIFT WHAT <span class='rd'>TODAY?</span></div><div clas